   "label": "Same pitches, sung, one note skipped, joined with 1 more",
   "note": "Your notes 1 to 8 (of 8) have the same pitches here, but not the same rhythm. In eighth notes, the score plays them as 1 2 1 1 1 1 1 1; yours are 3 4 1 1 1 1 1 2. The passage is sung, and the score has E of 1 eighth note between your notes 4 and 5 in the same line. The voice has no staff of its own, so this note is left out of the match. This joins 2 passages (levels 2, 2) that overlap, or lie within 1 measure of each other.",
   "libretto": [
    {
     "kind": "sung",
     "person": "Siegfried",
     "text": "He! Hehe! Ihr munt’ren Wasserminnen!",
